        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Cleo Demetriou, Sophia Kiely, Ameerah Falzon-Ojo, Sophia Dall'aglio, Kerry Ingram, Eleanor Worthington Cox\n- Works: So Awkward, Mache Man, Made of Paper\n- Roles: Lily Hampton, Jas (Jasmine) Salford, Martha Fitzgerald\n\nFacts:\n- Cleo Demetriou is known for playing Lily Hampton in the CBBC show So Awkward.\n- So Awkward stars Cleo Demetriou as Lily Hampton, Ameerah Falzon-Ojo as Jas (Jasmine) Salford, and Sophia Dall'aglio as Martha Fitzgerald.\n- Cleo Demetriou sang Made of Paper, the soundtrack for the short film Mache Man.\n- Sophia Kiely shared a role with Cleo Demetriou, Kerry Ingram, and Eleanor Worthington Cox.",
